 "rationale_zh": "本次提交新增“当前是否处于回调内部”的状态标志，并据此约束在 handler 内调用 XML_ParserReset/XML_ParserFree 等接口的行为，改动直接触及 harness 使用的接口：xml_parse_fuzzer 在字符数据回调中调用 XML_StopParser，并对奇数长度输入调用 XML_ParserReset。harness 并不在回调内部重置或释放解析器，用法与新约束兼容：变更前后都能编译，回放语料无新崩溃，新增的状态维护代码被执行。harness 仍然充分，属于显式 state 阴性。",
 "rationale_en": "This commit adds an 'inside a handler' state flag and uses it to constrain calls such as XML_ParserReset/XML_ParserFree made from inside handlers, directly touching interfaces the harness uses: xml_parse_fuzzer calls XML_StopParser from its character-data handler and XML_ParserReset for odd-sized inputs. The harness never resets or frees the parser from within a handler, so its usage is compatible with the new constraint: it builds before and after, replay shows no new crash, and the new state bookkeeping runs. The harness stays adequate: explicit state negative.",
 "discovery_route": "forward_scan",
 "gt_source": "experiment"
